<div class="container mt-4">
    <h1>How to Use GList</h1>

    <p class="mt-3">
        GList helps you keep track of the items you need to buy. 
        It's simple, intuitive, and easy to use.
    </p>

    <h3 class="mt-4">What You Can Do</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Add Items:</strong> Create a new item with its name, quantity, and any notes.</li>
        <li><strong>View Your List:</strong> See all the items you’ve added in one place.</li>
        <li><strong>Edit Items:</strong> Update an item’s name, quantity, or details anytime.</li>
        <li><strong>Delete Items:</strong> Remove items from your list when you no longer need them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="mt-4">How It Works</h3>
    <p>
        Click on “View G List” in the menu to get started. 
        From there, you can add new items or manage the items already on your list.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-3">
        GList keeps everything organized so shopping becomes faster and easier.
    </p>
</div>

